OL,3,GNEWSAThree treated at scene after gas
OL,4,Amain ruptures
OL,5,
OL,6,FA gas main rupture during upgrade work
OL,7,Fled to three people receiving medical
OL,8,Ftreatment at the scene and residents
OL,9,Fbeing forced to leave their homes.
OL,11,FFirefighters were called to Marchwood
OL,12,Fnear Southampton on Tuesday at about
OL,13,F12:30 GMT where work to replace a gas
OL,14,Fmain was being carried out by SGN on
OL,15,FMain Road and Hythe Road.
OL,17,FHampshire and Isle of Wight Fire and
OL,18,FRescue Service said crews set up a
OL,19,Fsafety cordon, evacuated nearby
OL,20,Fproperties and treated three
OL,21,Fcasualties. SGN said one engineer was
OL,22,Ftaken to hospital as a precaution.
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
